gQk(){return"What controls the day master, same polarity \u2014 pressure with no cushion. Force, risk and decisive action: well handled it is courage, badly handled it is being driven."},
gQ4(){return"What controls the day master, opposite polarity \u2014 authority one accepts. Office, rules, reputation and duty. In a woman's chart it traditionally stands for the husband as well."},
gQe(){return"What produces the day master, same polarity \u2014 support given unevenly. Intuition, unusual learning and a mind that goes its own way; traditionally it can also starve the Eating God."},
gQ6(){return"What produces the day master, opposite polarity \u2014 support given steadily. Education, protection and backing; traditionally the mother. It strengthens the day master and softens the pressure on it."},
